        "Description": "Hello 47. Today, your target is a small cartel that claims to sell propane. In truth, this &quot;fauxpane&quot; is produced outside the Propagne region of France, and bears no resemblance to the genuine article except for color, odor, mass, and reactivity. This violates Protected Designation of Origin laws and endangers buyers expecting the genuine article. A suitable disguise has been placed in the Attic Chamber. Eliminate the cartel leaders and destroy the six canisters of fauxpane. Good hunting, 47.",
